{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"w":0.069958845774332645,"t":"1718867188","x":0.7716049391467531,"y":0.046511627815394085},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.10288065652802394,"w":0.16460905710856119,"t":"Questions 27-31","y":0.09738372079030011,"c":1},{"w":0.34773661295572916,"c":1,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","x":0.1008230514420409,"h":0.01751376490149259,"y":0.13074204920335086},{"y":0.16187327547457198,"c":1,"w":0.53726704915364576,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 27-31 on your answer sheet.","h":0.017659705715830976,"x":0.10276637634532733},{"c":1,"t":"27 What point does Shester make about Barr's book in the first paragraph?","x":0.100823043282725,"y":0.18895348822593361,"w":0.67901234944661459,"h":0.015993508068214979},{"t":"It gives a highly original explanation for urban development.","y":0.21410507080326235,"c":1,"w":0.53098678588867188,"x":0.18512277278389735,"h":0.01773880058800803},{"x":0.18518519514755971,"y":0.23110465102942257,"t":"Elements of Barr's research papers are incorporated throughout the book.","w":0.65637858072916666,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1},{"t":"Other books that are available on the subject have taken a different approach.","h":0.014553715960858749,"c":1,"y":0.24852767951637811,"w":0.69135803222656245,"x":0.18724279448279921},{"y":0.26442873984490534,"x":0.18312757765635315,"t":"It covers a range of factors that affected the development of New York.","w":0.62962961832682296,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"28","x":0.10082304478148536,"y":0.29069767423564397,"w":0.026748971939086916,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.69135803222656245,"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"y":0.29063604266181442,"t":"How does Shester respond to the information in the book about tenements?","x":0.12345678625614918},{"h":0.01309851566669662,"y":0.31684334491256683,"x":0.18724280060524431,"c":1,"t":"She describes the reasons for Barr's interest.","w":0.40123456319173179},{"t":"B","x":0.14403292184517943,"y":0.33284883698273693,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073223,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.14403292184517943,"y":0.35029069749725195,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.016460905075073251,"t":"C"},{"y":0.3662790695190743,"c":1,"x":0.14403292186575556,"w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"D"},{"y":0.33127208469654268,"t":"She indicates a potential problem with Barr's analysis.","x":0.18518519891065049,"w":0.48353907267252599,"h":0.017667844522968323,"c":1},{"y":0.34738372111711668,"t":"She compares Barr's conclusion with that of other writers.","h":0.017457268403753057,"w":0.51646087646484373,"c":1,"x":0.18312758437560292},{"c":1,"y":0.36627906962091006,"t":"She provides details about the sources Barr used for his research.","w":0.59259256998697918,"x":0.18312758321565203,"h":0.015988372380376759},{"x":0.10073601396349763,"t":"29 What does Shester say about chapter six of the book?","y":0.39048858978855017,"h":0.017810788957755341,"c":1,"w":0.52487162272135413},{"c":1,"w":0.2432749684651693,"t":"It contains conflicting data.","x":0.18290494583805914,"y":0.41638474922116797,"h":0.017380194894276224},{"t":"B","x":0.14609053479805151,"y":0.43459302300744629,"w":0.014403292338053375,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"y":0.43459302312059911,"c":1,"x":0.18106995952781971,"t":"It focuses too much on possible trends.","w":0.35596707661946614,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"c":1,"x":0.14403292186575556,"t":"C","w":0.016460905075073251,"y":0.45058139510046957,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"t":"It is too specialised for most readers.","y":0.45053003553339643,"x":0.18518518948759816,"w":0.33127571105957027,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.46802325561256208,"x":0.14403292184517943,"t":"D","w":0.016460905075073223,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"h":0.016037607361486961,"t":"It draws on research that is out of date.","c":1,"w":0.35208569844563797,"y":0.46657978899170582,"x":0.18507493056056565},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.69547322591145844,"y":0.49263839809983856,"c":1,"x":0.13991770792383534,"t":"What does Shester suggest about the chapters focusing on the 1920s building"},{"y":0.50861936813379294,"w":0.06593291600545248,"t":"boom?","c":1,"h":0.014738007625224925,"x":0.14398827491818134},{"x":0.18724279918585296,"w":0.49382715861002602,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"t":"The information should have been organised differently.","y":0.53474676068195659},{"x":0.14609053479805151,"t":"B","w":0.014403292338053375,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.55232558117457753},{"t":"C","w":0.016460905075073251,"c":1,"y":0.56831395324000444,"x":0.14403292186575556,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"t":"D","y":0.58575581372692298,"x":0.14403292184517943,"w":0.016460905075073223,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"w":0.57613169352213545,"t":"More facts are needed about the way construction was financed.","h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.18518518194263606,"y":0.55232558127539044,"c":1},{"t":"The explanation that is given for the building boom is unlikely.","x":0.18106995936631468,"y":0.56831395333910495,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.55144032796223963},{"w":0.47530863444010418,"c":1,"y":0.58568904593277848,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"Some parts will have limited appeal to certain people.","x":0.18724280201490687},{"y":0.61042402839668608,"t":"What impresses Shester the most about the chapter on land values?","w":0.6193415832519531,"c":1,"h":0.014575971731448756,"x":0.13168723296460749},{"w":0.32716049194335933,"y":0.63662790684007264,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"x":0.18518518605592665,"t":"the broad time period that is covered"},{"t":"B the interesting questions that Barr asks","w":0.38708333333333333,"c":1,"y":0.65320032738295875,"h":0.015329579442072583,"x":0.14596142297803169},{"x":0.14601146454705349,"y":0.66854892430163415,"t":"C the nature of the research into the topic","w":0.39109291076660158,"h":0.016043967436845552,"c":1},{"w":0.46090535481770828,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.68749999987928656,"t":"D the recommendations Barr makes for the future","x":0.14609053235635922},{"c":1,"y":0.86773255796252025,"w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.8580246914705375,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"69"},{"c":1,"w":0.30612408955891934,"y":0.95314993857250241,"h":0.03370105756887698,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.66991924052010743}]}